  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>a</mi></math> and <math><mi>b</mi></math> are positive integers such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>107</mn><mi>i</mi></math> (where <math><mi>N</mi></math> is a natural number), then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> is equal to (where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>)"
