  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>107</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo></math> Natural number<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>107</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo></math>Natural number<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>107</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>107</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>107</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>107</mn></math> is a multiple of <math><mn>3</mn></math> and&nbsp;<math><mi>b</mi></math> is a factor of <math><mn>107</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>108</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br />{<math><mi>b</mi></math> cannot be equal to <math><mn>107</mn></math>, because <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>107</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>107</mn></math> is not a multiple of <math><mn>3</mn></math>}"
  }
